    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="class_node" kindref="compound">Node</ref> - Each edge bundle corresponds to a Hopfield node. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The node contains precomputed frequency data that only depends on the CFG, but Bias and Links are computed each time placeSpills is called.</para>
<para>The node <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">Value</ref> is positive when the variable should be in a register. The value can change when linked nodes change, but convergence is very fast because all weights are positive. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
